<style>
    .privacy-container {
        background-color: white;
        border-radius: 15px;
        padding: 1rem;
    }
</style>

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container">
    <div class="privacy-container d-flex flex-column gap-3">
        <h1 class="fw-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>
            <strong>1. Who We Are SpacedRep</strong> is operated by Rodney Madondo, based in South Africa. This policy
            explains how we handle your personal information in compliance with the Protection of Personal
            Information Act (POPIA).
        </p>

        
        <div>
            <p><strong>2. What We Collect</strong></p>
            <ul class="pl-3">

                <li>Your email address when you register</li>
                <li>Files you upload (PDFs, Word documents, text files)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
            <p><strong>3. How We Use Your Information</strong></p>
            <ul class="pl-3">

                <li>
                    Your email address is used to send account confirmation emails
                </li>
                <li>
                    Your email address is used to send automated study reminder notifications on scheduled
                    review dates via a background job system based on spaced repetition intervals
                </li>
                <li>
                    Your uploaded files are processed to generate quizzes using AI
                </li>
                <li>We do not sell your data to anyone</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
            <p>
                <strong>4. Third Parties We Share Data With</strong> We work with carefully selected third party service providers to
                operate SpacedRep. Your data may be shared with the following categories of providers:
            </p>
            <ul class="pl-3">

                <li>
                    An email delivery provider receives your email address solely to deliver transactional and
                    reminder emails on our behalf
                </li>
                <li>
                    A file storage provider securely stores files you upload to the platform
                </li>
                <li>
                    Your uploaded files are processed to generate quizzes using AI
                </li>
                <li>
                    An AI processing provider receives the content of your uploaded files solely for the purpose
                    of generating quizzes. File content is not stored by us after processing
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                All third party providers are contractually obligated to handle your data securely and only for the
                purposes described above.
            </p>
        </div>

        <p>
            <strong>5. Data Retention</strong> We keep your account data and uploaded files for as long as your account is active.
            You can delete your files at any time from within the app. To delete your account contact us directly.

        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>6. Your Rights Under POPIA </strong>
            You have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of your
            personal information at any time. To exercise these rights contact us at
            madondotakundaoriginal@gmail.com
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>7. Security  </strong>
            We take reasonable steps to protect your data. However no system is completely secure
            and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>8. Children  </strong>
            SpacedRep is not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from
            children.
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>9. Changes to This Policy  </strong>
            We may update this policy at any time. We will notify you of significant
            changes via email.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>10. Contact </strong>
            For any privacy related queries contact us at madondotakundaoriginal@gmail.com .
        </p>



        
       
    </div>
</div>